# Wave W-DIFF3: towerroof — dressed stone-slab roof of Iris City
# (Tower Stone & Maple kit). Wide ashlar courses with a lit top
# edge and a deep seam line, in the KIT_VARIANTS violet roof tones
# (#8d84a0 / #5b5470 / #aba2bc) — the tower-town stone of
# JOHTO_TOWN_STYLE violet's form line, drawn as masonry rather
# than shingle so Iris's houses read as stone-built where
# Cragmoor's read as drake-shingle and Eldergrove's as thatch.
# Solid wall-class roof tile, swapped onto house-stamp roof cells
# only (W-DIFF drakeroof precedent).
